{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1022085-digital-web-3-0-the-web-of-today","id":1022085,"title":"Digital Web 3.0: The Web of Today!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-12-25T13:59:14-08:00","id":1022085,"title":"Digital Web 3.0: The Web of Today!","content":"Reading back over Digital Web 2.0 and it's amazing to see just how dated it's become.<br /> M20's small section on it has suggested a good way of modernising it (pp. 107-109).<br /> <br /> The long and short of it is that Grid sectors have become much larger, encompassing the internet as the majority of us have actually experienced. All the other bits, the SRVRZ, the VA sectors, the crazy clubs and Tron games, all of that is either Dark web or Deep web.<br /> <br /> Tone wise, there is no longer an emphasis on the Great Race. The Sleepers pretty much took over, and no one side, not the VAs, nor the Technocracy, has any real control over it anymore. However, N.W.O do have a leg up over the rest. One of their factions, The Feed, has managed to install a form of mass surveillance over the vast majority of the Grid, and a number of C-Sectors to boot.<br /> <br /> However, it seems we're not going to get many details until DW3.0 comes out. So until then, why not make up some details by ourselves?<br /> <br /> Just chose a website and go crazy.<br /> <br /> I imagine Google looking like the inside of a great white sphere, with Conduit platforms lining the walls. You start out at the centre of the sphere with the great Google logo hovering right in the middle. Anything you said aloud to the logo would trigger the Search algorithm. sections of the wall would zoom in right up to you (or you to it, it's difficult to tell) with conduits leading to places related to your search. It is impossible to get to anywhere that isn't 